{
  "name": "InOut AI - 70 WhatsApp Response Sender",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "contract-note",
      "name": "Input Output Contract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -720,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Whatsapp Response Sender\n\nValidates a single WhatsApp recipient, chooses text or approved template, sends through WhatsApp Cloud API, stores provider message id, and returns the provider result.\n\nInput: Recipient phone, customer-service window flag, message text or template payload, idempotency key, and conversation context.\nOutput: { success: true, providerMessageId: \"\", notificationStatus: \"\", to: \"\" }\n\nShared Input Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"correlationId\": \"\",\n  \"messageId\": \"\",\n  \"conversationId\": \"\",\n  \"customerId\": \"\",\n  \"customerPhone\": \"\",\n  \"detectedLanguage\": \"\",\n  \"intent\": \"\",\n  \"payload\": {}\n}\n```\n\nShared Output Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n  \"data\": {},\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"correlationId\": \"\",\n    \"workflow\": \"\",\n    \"durationMs\": 0\n  }\n}\n```\n\nRequired fields:\n- correlationId\n- workflowExecutionId\n- idempotencyKey when writing\n\nRules:\n- One recipient per API request; never place multiple numbers in to.\n- Use approved template outside customer-service window.\n- Prevent duplicate sends using idempotency key and notification log.\n- Store provider message ID and handle rate limits and timeouts."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workflow-input",
      "name": "Workflow Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -680,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "validate-recipient",
      "name": "Validate Recipient",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -760,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "single-uae-recipient",
              "leftValue": "={{/^9715\\d{8}$/.test(String($json.to || $json.from || $json.customerPhone || $json.customer_phone || \"\").replace(/[^0-9]/g, \"\")) && !String($json.to || \"\").includes(\",\") && !String($json.to || \"\").includes(\";\")}}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "determine-message-type",
      "name": "Determine Message Type",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        -500,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "rules",
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{Boolean($json.templateName || ($json.template && $json.template.name) || $json.customerServiceWindowOpen === false || $json.requiresTemplate)}}",
                    "rightValue": true,
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "boolean",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "TEMPLATE"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
              "leftValue": "={{Boolean($json.customer_reply_override || (($json.ai || {}).response) || (($json.agent || {}).response) || (($json.data || {}).response) || $json.response || $json.reply || $json.messageText || $json.customerMessage || $json.text || (typeof $json.message === 'string' ? $json.message : (($json.message || {}).text || {}).body))}}",
                    "rightValue": true,
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "boolean",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "TEXT"
            }
          ]
        },
        "fallbackOutput": "extra",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "prepare-text-message",
      "name": "Prepare Text Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -220,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const input = $json || {};\nconst firstText = (...values) => {\n  for (const value of values) {\n    if (typeof value === 'string' && value.trim()) return value.trim();\n  }\n  return '';\n};\nconst messageBody = firstText(\n  input.customer_reply_override,\n  input.ai?.response,\n  input.agent?.response,\n  input.data?.response,\n  input.response,\n  input.reply,\n  input.messageText,\n  input.customerMessage,\n  input.text,\n  typeof input.message === 'string' ? input.message : input.message?.text?.body\n);\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...input,\n    to: String(input.to || input.from || input.customerPhone || input.customer_phone || '').replace(/[^0-9]/g, ''),\n    messageType: 'text',\n    messageBody: messageBody || 'وصلت رسالتك، وسيقوم فريق خدمة العملاء بمراجعتها والرد عليك قريباً.',\n    idempotencyKey: input.idempotencyKey || input.idempotency_key || input.wamid || input.correlationId || String($execution.id || ''),\n    correlationId: input.correlationId || input.correlation_id || 'corr_' + Date.now(),\n  },\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "prepare-template-message",
      "name": "Prepare Template Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -220,
        -100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const input = $json;\nconst template = input.template || {};\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...input,\n    to: String(input.to || input.from || input.customerPhone || input.customer_phone || '').replace(/[^0-9]/g, ''),\n    messageType: 'template',\n    templateName: input.templateName || template.name || 'customer_service_followup',\n    templateLanguage: input.templateLanguage || input.language || 'ar',\n    templateParameters: input.templateParameters || template.parameters || [],\n    idempotencyKey: input.idempotencyKey || input.idempotency_key || input.wamid || input.correlationId || String($execution.id || ''),\n    correlationId: input.correlationId || input.correlation_id || 'corr_' + Date.now(),\n  },\n}];"
      }
    },
